  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB (Swedish Civil Contingencies Agency) Humanitarian Frame for all   humanitarian contributions financed by Sida&apos;s Humanitarian Unit. The  contributions consist of secondments, base camps, medical teams etc   in support of UN Organizations. Own contributions are capacity        development projects in connection with the establishment of rescue   services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSB Humanit&#xe4;r ram f&#xf6;r samtliga humanit&#xe4;ra insatser som finansieras av Sidas humanit&#xe4;ra enhet. Insatserna best&#xe5;r av sekunderingar, base      camps, medicinska team mm och &#xe4;r till st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r FN-organisationer.     Egna insatser &#xe4;r kapacitetsinsatser i form av uppbyggande av          r&#xe4;ddningstj&#xe4;nster</narrative>
  </description>
